span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">太阳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195178\">マリーゴールドは<ruby>太陽<rp>(</rp><rt>たいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とともに<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玛丽黄金与太阳一起醒来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">平ら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">平坦；平；水平；光滑；平静；安宁；平和；镇定；稳定；（坐姿）随意；放松地坐；舒适（多作「お平らに」）；高原；台地；平原</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230999\">あの<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>頂上<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>平<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那座山顶是平的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大陸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいりく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大陆；洲；亚洲大陆（尤指中国大陆）；欧洲大陆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230381\">アフリカは<ruby>大陸<rp>(</rp><rt>たいりく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であるが、グリーンランドはそうではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">非洲是一个大陆, 而格陵兰不是。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/766465\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">対立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对立；对抗；对峙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166449\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはそのことで<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>対立<rp>(</rp><rt>たいりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们对此有争议的意见。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">体力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">体力；力量；耐力；精力；抵抗力；（企业、经济等的）实力；底气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137959\"><ruby>体力<rp>(</rp><rt>たいりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>維持<rp>(</rp><rt>いじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するにはちゃんと<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べなければいけません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">要保持身体力量,就必须吃得好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">タイル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瓷砖；地砖；墙砖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">対話</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对话；谈话；讨论；交流</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">田植え</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たうえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">水稻插秧；插秧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶えず</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たえず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不断地；持续地；始终</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96708\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>絶<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えずけんかばかりしていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们一直在争吵。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">絶える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">断绝；消亡；灭绝；停止；中断；中止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221251\">この<ruby>習慣<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>絶<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>久<rp>(</rp><rt>ひさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种习惯已经停止了很久。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">耐える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">忍耐；承受；经受；支撑；承受；抵御；顶住；胜任；能担当</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230638\">あの<ruby>騒音<rp>(</rp><rt>そうおん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>耐<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられないよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能忍受那种噪音。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たおす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推倒；击倒；砍倒；放倒；使侧卧；使倾斜；杀死；打败；击败；推翻；绊倒；毁坏；拖欠；欺骗；彻底做；充分做；尽力做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170837\"><ruby>座席<rp>(</rp><rt>ざせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>背<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してもいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以把座位倒在背上吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">タオル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毛巾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203850\">タオルは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">毛巾完全没起作用。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2442255\" title=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たおれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倒下；跌倒；摔倒；倾覆；被摧毁；坍塌；崩裂；崩坏；倒塌；卧床不起；患病；累垮；死亡；被杀；破产；倒闭；衰落；失败；战败；输掉；推翻；被推翻；失去政权</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109533\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>横<rp>(</rp><rt>よこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にばったり<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他倒在旁边。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">高</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数量；数额；体积；数目；金额</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">高い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">高的；贵的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">このレストランは<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这家餐厅很贵。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">高まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たかまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">上升；高涨；获得提升</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183906\"><ruby>歓呼<rp>(</rp><rt>かんこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどよめきにまで<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">欢呼的声音升高到无声。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">高める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たかめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">提高；抬高；增强；提升</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209257\">その<ruby>小説<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>名声<rp>(</rp><rt>めいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>更<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这部小说增加了他的名声。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たから</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宝贝；珍宝；财宝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168850\"><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎたる<ruby>宝<rp>(</rp><rt>たから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なし。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">孩子是宝中之宝。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/349283\" title=\"Tatoeba · zhouj1955\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · zhouj1955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">互い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">互相；彼此</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220241\">この<ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>兄弟<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>互<rp>(</rp><rt>たが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>似<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这两个兄弟是相似的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">耕す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たがやす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">耕耘；耕作；开垦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121708\"><ruby>農家<rp>(</rp><rt>のうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>鋤<rp>(</rp><rt>すき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>土<rp>(</rp><rt>つち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>耕<rp>(</rp><rt>たがや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">农民用草地种植土地。</span></div></li>"]